\n\n- A young Persian warrior with long dark hair.\n- Wear dark leather armor and carry two swords.\n- Smooth running, jumping, rolling and climbing animations.\n\nGAMEPLAY:\n\n- Side-scrolling 2D platformer.\n- Run, jump, double jump, climb walls and swing from poles.\n- Perform wall runs along vertical walls.\n- Slide under traps and avoid deadly obstacles.\n- Fight enemies using sword combos.\n- Add blocking, dodging and counterattack mechanics.\n- Include boss battles.\n\nTIME MECHANICS:\n\n- Add a magical time-rewind ability.\n- Allow the player to rewind the last 5 seconds.\n- Add a limited time-energy meter.\n\nLEVEL DESIGN:\n\n- Ancient Persian palace.\n- Underground prison.\n- Abandoned temple.\n- Dark fortress.\n- Dangerous traps, spikes, swinging blades and collapsing platforms.\n\nENEMIES:\n\n- Medieval guards with swords.\n- Armored warriors.\n- Fast shadow creatures.\n- Powerful bosses.\n\nCONTROLS:\n\n- Mobile touchscreen controls.\n- Left and right movement buttons.\n- Jump button.\n- Attack button.\n- Block button.\n- Time rewind button.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nCreate a fully playable game, not just a visual mockup.\nImplement functional player movement, combat, enemy AI, collision detection, animations, traps, checkpoints and level progression.\nOptimize the game for mobile phone screens.\nStart by building a complete playable first level.","comments":[],"attachments":[],"agent":"build","model":{"modelID":"oc/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"omdev"}},"time":{"created":1794428790529},"text":"Create a high-quality 2D side-scrolling action platformer inspired by the dark atmosphere and acrobatic combat of Prince of Persia: Warrior Within (2004).\n\nGAME TITLE: SHADOWS OF THE LOST KINGDOM\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\n\n- Dark medieval fantasy atmosphere.\n- Detailed ancient Persian castles, ruins, dungeons and temples.\n- Beautiful 2D backgrounds with parallax scrolling.\n- Realistic character animations and cinematic lighting.\n- Dark blue, grey and bronze color p